<section class="panel" aria-label="Grade 3 Unit 4 Lesson 14"><h2>Two groups of twelve</h2><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem"><span aria-label="One group of 12 (one ten plus 2 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 12 (one ten plus 2 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●</span></div><p>Source shows two loose twelve-square groups and two ten-rod representations with differing orientation, all24.</p><h2>Tyler: seven thirteens</h2><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem"><span aria-label="One group of 13 (one ten plus 3 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 13 (one ten plus 3 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 13 (one ten plus 3 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 13 (one ten plus 3 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 13 (one ten plus 3 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 13 (one ten plus 3 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 13 (one ten plus 3 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●</span></div><p>7×13=70+21=91;3×14=42, optional4×12=48 and5×16=80.</p><h2>Andre, Clare, Diego: three models, one product</h2><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem"><span aria-label="One group of 15 (one ten plus 5 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 15 (one ten plus 5 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●●●</span><span aria-label="One group of 15 (one ten plus 5 ones)" style="border:1px solid;padding:.3rem">▦ ●●●●●</span></div><p>3×15=3×10+3×5=30+15=45. Andre uses a gridded rectangle, Clare base-ten groups and Diego an ungridded area diagram. Teacher checks each independently.</p><p>Independent visual models; seven original 2021 source SVGs were visually inspected but not reproduced. <a href="https://im.kendallhunt.com/k5/teachers/grade-3/unit-4/lesson-14/lesson.html">Source teacher lesson</a></p></section>
